ener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-damac-properties/\">DAMAC</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-sobha-realty/\">Sobha</a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-imtiaz-developments/\">Imtiaz</a>.&nbsp;</p><p>Visitors can explore future-ready communities, visualize upcoming projects, and experience the craftsmanship and innovation shaping Dubai’s skyline, all under one roof.</p><p>Beyond the impressive displays, the DWTC branch serves as an interactive hub for investors and homeowners alike.</p>"}},"strapi_id":44,"strapi_component":"modules.content-and-stats","heading":"about provident boutique branch – DWTC","stats":[]},{"id":"7833f274-519e-532b-a116-45154075641d","title":"Say hello to the Boutique Branch – DWTC team","strapi_id":59,"strapi_component":"modules.global-module","heading":"meet the team","choose_module":"team_slider","bg_color":null,"cta_text":{"id":"fa351a45-5257-5c46-9ab5-d0f7365882e7","text":"Our team of over 130 people are ready to assist you","cta":{"cta_label":"Meet the full team","custom_link":null,"isExternal":false,"icon":null,"id":"29463481-2b64-5210-9e39-d752bbe6ee53","strapi_id":2677,"menu":null}},"design_title":{"data":{"design_title":""}}},{"id":"89a453f5-3ca3-5ac5-b727-96fb27a13a59","strapi_id":9,"strapi_component":"modules.office-location","offices":[]},{"id":"2a730100-f7bd-5d24-82f1-9fe61f73fd7c","title":"Discover Property in Dubai","strapi_id":28,"strapi_component":"modules.featured-prop-slider","description":{"data":{"description":""}},"is_signature":null,"logo_image":null,"cta_text":{"id":"a15ebf7f-0633-53bb-bafc-e9c44e93216e","text":"View all properties for sale, to rent, or off plan projects.","cta":{"cta_label":"View more properties.","custom_link":"/property/for-sale/","isExternal":false,"icon":null,"id":"06693169-d6ac-5b87-bc71-4ab7